1
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:09,600
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:12,693
=Episode 6=

3
00:00:12,773 --> 00:00:15,760
(A ruthless, scheming madwoman.)

4
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:19,560
Put this golden chrysanthemum
by the east window.

5
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:20,880
There's good light over there.

6
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:21,680
Yes.

7
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:24,000
This one has a lovely shape.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Put it up front.

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:25,600
Yes.

10
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:34,080
What's going on?

11
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:36,080
Your Highness, somehow,

12
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:36,960
this flower has wilted.

13
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,920
We checked them all so carefully.

14
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:39,640
Hurry.

15
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:41,320
Get the gardeners here.

16
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:44,080
Tomorrow is the late Empress's
birthday memorial.

17
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:45,120
If anything goes wrong,

18
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:47,640
how will I face her spirit?

19
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:49,080
Yes, Your Highness.

20
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:50,680
Please don't worry.

21
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:51,600
Your health comes first.

22
00:00:52,146 --> 00:00:53,520
Greetings, Sister.

23
00:00:54,506 --> 00:00:55,690
(Concubine Rou)

24
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:56,840
What's troubling you?

25
00:00:58,760 --> 00:01:00,000
Your Highness.

26
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:02,520
Tomorrow is the late Empress's
birthday memorial.

27
00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:05,320
But the chrysanthemums
have been damaged.

28
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:06,720
So Her Highness is anxious.

29
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:10,280
How could you be so careless?

30
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:12,600
Consort Qi holds her memory dear.

31
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:14,000
How could you be so negligent?

32
00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:15,320
If this ruins the rites,

33
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:17,600
you'll all lose your heads!

34
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:20,000
Greetings, Consort Qi.

35
00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:21,120
Greetings, Concubine Rou.

36
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,680
Your Highness.

37
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:34,720
The Jade Phoenix was damaged by

38
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:36,920
a powder called Wither-and-Bloom.

39
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:39,120
I found peck marks

40
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:40,760
on the leaves and petals.

41
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:43,640
I assume some birds
carried the poison powder

42
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:45,160
and damaged the flowers.

43
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:46,600
Wither-and-Bloom?

44
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:47,680
That's right.

45
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:50,560
It's normally used to keep pests
off plants.

46
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:52,960
But too much of it poisons the plant.

47
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:53,920
Your Highness.

48
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:57,160
Birds did perch on the chrysanthemums.

49
00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:58,560
I just shooed them away.

50
00:01:58,720 --> 00:02:01,560
But this powder is poison.

51
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,280
It isn't freely used in the palace.

52
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:04,800
I suspect

53
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,000
something is amiss.

54
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:08,680
Where in the palace can we find it?

55
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:10,280
As far as I know,

56
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,280
only in the cold palace,

57
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:13,480
where servants grow vegetables to eat.

58
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,320
When pests get bad,

59
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:16,840
they'd sprinkle some.

60
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:25,960
Out!

61
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:27,520
Out!

62
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:40,160
You dare refuse to kneel before me?

63
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:40,920
Guards.

64
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:42,200
Seize her.

65
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,160
Yes.

66
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:46,280
Kneel!

67
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:52,000
How dare you look at me like that.

68
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,040
Gouge out her eyes.

69
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:54,840
Yes.

70
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:56,440
Noble Consort Hui.

71
00:02:56,720 --> 00:02:57,520
Under His Majesty's rule,

72
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,280
within the harem,

73
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:00,040
you ignore law and rule,

74
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:00,920
and abuse your power.

75
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:02,920
Aren't you afraid His Majesty will rage?

76
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:04,760
I hold the rank of Noble Consort.

77
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:06,720
Punishing a discarded consort

78
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:08,000
needs no law or rule.

79
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,680
I'll take responsibility.

80
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:10,640
Gouge them out.

81
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:11,360
Yes!

82
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:12,600
Let's see who dares!

83
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,360
Let go of her.

84
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:31,840
Consort Qi?

85
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:34,240
Are you turning against me too?

86
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:35,560
Noble Consort,

87
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:37,320
why all this talk of

88
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:38,400
beating and killing?

89
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:40,560
Auntie Sun, speak.

90
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:41,480
Yes.

91
00:03:42,880 --> 00:03:45,440
This wretch bewitched the cold palace

92
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:46,560
and spread rumors.

93
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:49,360
She claims Zhaoyi Shen is
under Noble Consort's protection.

94
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:51,440
Her affair

95
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:53,640
was permitted by Noble Consort.

96
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:55,880
For this insolence,

97
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:57,560
and for slandering her mistress,

98
00:03:57,720 --> 00:03:58,640
the rules demand

99
00:03:59,040 --> 00:04:00,960
that her tongue be cut out,

100
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:01,960
her eyes gouged out,

101
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,040
and that she be thrown into a pigsty

102
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:05,080
to live with pigs.

103
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:06,480
And...

104
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,400
Never rise again!

105
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,440
Guards.

106
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:13,840
Seize Auntie Sun.

107
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:16,000
No...

108
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:16,560
No!

109
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:17,440
But...

110
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:18,520
On what grounds?

111
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:19,400
On what grounds?

112
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:23,080
Because someone under your watch
poisoned a consort.

113
00:04:23,520 --> 00:04:24,960
As its matron,

114
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:27,160
you deserve death.

115
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,000
Eunuch Wang.

116
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:31,040
Search every room in the cold palace.

117
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,560
Leave no corner unchecked.

118
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:33,200
Yes.

119
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:34,120
Search!

120
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:38,600
Consort Qi.

121
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,720
Surely you've made a mistake.

122
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:41,160
The cold palace has strict rules.

123
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:43,000
No one can leave.

124
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:45,680
Even if someone wanted to poison you,

125
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:48,920
they'd have no way to get out.

126
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:52,160
Consort Qi.

127
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:54,520
I found a packet of powder

128
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:55,880
in Auntie Sun's room.

129
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:58,360
It's actually Wither-and-Bloom.

130
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:01,040
Auntie Sun.

131
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,640
What do you have to say?

132
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,880
This Wither-and-Bloom...

133
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:07,880
It's just used
to kill pests on vegetables.

134
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:08,960
What does that

135
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,200
have to do

136
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:12,240
with poisoning?

137
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:13,360
How dare you!

138
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:15,400
Caught red-handed, yet you deny it!

139
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,880
You're merely a matron,

140
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:17,760
yet you dare defy the throne

141
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,000
and poison a consort.

142
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:21,480
Take her to ​the Office of Punishment​.

143
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:22,920
Interrogate her harshly.

144
00:05:23,080 --> 00:05:25,200
No!

145
00:05:25,440 --> 00:05:26,920
Your Highness, save me!

146
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,640
How dare you.

147
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:28,520
Who dares?

148
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:32,360
Consort Qi, don't think
His Majesty's favor

149
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,680
gives you free rein.

150
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:35,320
I hold the rank of Noble Consort.

151
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:37,080
Unless you produce solid evidence,

152
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:39,200
you won't take her from me.

153
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:40,160
Noble Consort.

154
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,240
The chrysanthemums for

155
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:44,600
the late Empress's birthday memorial
were ruined by this powder.

156
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:46,960
I just found evidence

157
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:48,400
in Auntie Sun's room.

158
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:51,040
No matter how high your rank,

159
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:53,320
would you defy His Majesty's will

160
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:55,760
and the late Empress's honor?

161
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,360
We've checked the records.

162
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,920
In the whole harem,

163
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:03,320
only Auntie Sun had Wither-and-Bloom.

164
00:06:03,440 --> 00:06:04,920
If not her,

165
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,320
who else could it be?

166
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:08,240
Your Highness!

167
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:10,360
Please see this clearly!

168
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:13,600
I've served you all these years!

169
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:15,320
Your Highness, I'm innocent.

170
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:15,880
I'm innocent!

171
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:17,360
So, are you saying

172
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,080
someone ordered you to do it?

173
00:06:19,960 --> 00:06:20,760
Indeed.

174
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:23,640
How would a mere servant dare ruin

175
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:25,560
Consort Qi's offerings?

176
00:06:25,880 --> 00:06:27,640
Someone must be behind it,

177
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,640
for her to defy Consort Qi.

178
00:06:30,960 --> 00:06:31,920
You wretch!

179
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:32,720
Randomly accusing!

180
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:34,920
If you have nothing to hide,

181
00:06:35,280 --> 00:06:36,280
why so furious?

182
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:37,840
Auntie Sun often said,

183
00:06:37,880 --> 00:06:39,120
she had your backing.

184
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,440
So she dared do anything.

185
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,320
Everything Auntie Sun did

186
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:44,560
was approved by you.

187
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:47,120
Everyone here can bear witness.

188
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,160
Outrageous!

189
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,520
Guards!

190
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:03,840
Auntie Sun defies me and slanders me.

191
00:07:04,640 --> 00:07:05,680
Beat her to death.

192
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:06,880
Yes.

193
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:08,440
No, Your Highness!

194
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:10,680
You can't abandon me now!

195
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,360
Consort Qi.

196
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:15,920
I can cure

197
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:16,760
this poison.

198
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:20,200
My grandmother was skilled at plants.

199
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:21,960
I learned from her.

200
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:23,000
Wither-and-Bloom

201
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:25,320
is also known as Root-Breaker.

202
00:07:25,400 --> 00:07:27,960
It's made from chinaberry bark,
croton powder,

203
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,040
and honeylocust thorns.

204
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:29,920
Ground to powder,

205
00:07:30,080 --> 00:07:32,560
it kills insects and weeds.

206
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:34,200
But if too much is used,

207
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:35,480
it damages the roots.

208
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:37,320
The leaves turn yellow and curl,

209
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:38,320
and the stems ooze sap.

210
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:39,600
Within three days,

211
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:40,680
there may still be hope.

212
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:41,520
Are you sure?

213
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:43,840
The gardeners said
they couldn't be saved.

214
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:45,120
The palace gardeners

215
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:47,200
care for rare blooms,

216
00:07:47,280 --> 00:07:50,320
they'd never risk folk remedies.

217
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:52,240
Then come with me to Zhongning Palace.

218
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,440
See what you can do.

219
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:55,120
If you can save the chrysanthemums

220
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,840
and ease my trouble,

221
00:07:57,120 --> 00:08:00,080
I'll ask His Majesty to reward you.

222
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:01,520
Yes.

223
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:02,720
Very well.

224
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:04,000
Consort Qi.

225
00:08:04,440 --> 00:08:05,680
We'll see about that.

226
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:08,240
Back to the palace.

227
00:08:29,760 --> 00:08:30,200
Fu Rong.

228
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:35,920
You're still here.

229
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,440
Why put yourself through this?

230
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,520
After Lingxi died,

231
00:08:40,920 --> 00:08:43,160
I didn't want to live either.

232
00:08:43,680 --> 00:08:46,920
I thought I'd die here
in the cold palace.

233
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:48,400
But I never thought

234
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:51,480
I'd see you again.

235
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:53,240
Chengyan,

236
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,480
tell me.

237
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:57,680
If my grandmother had lived,

238
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:59,000
would we have

239
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,840
been married by now?

240
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:04,280
We could've

241
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:07,760
lived a comfortable life,

242
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:09,600
growing old together.

243
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:14,360
Lingxi wouldn't be born to royalty,

244
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:17,720
and die so cruelly.

245
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:33,840
Physician Li secretly meets
a discarded consort at night.

246
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,920
If word gets out,

247
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:37,200
your career

248
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:39,280
could be over.

249
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:41,320
So you're threatening me now?

250
00:09:41,640 --> 00:09:43,320
You just joined the Imperial Hospital.

251
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:46,040
You don't yet know the palace's cruelty.

252
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:50,600
You've used me again and again.

253
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:52,360
You wicked woman!

254
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,760
You'll do anything for revenge.

255
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:55,840
Where is the gentle Fu Rong I once knew?

256
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:59,480
That Fu Rong died long ago.

257
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:01,800
In front of you now

258
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:04,280
is a woman avenging her daughter,

259
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:07,640
who'll stop at nothing.

260
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:09,760
The only reason I'm still alive

261
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:11,760
is to get justice

262
00:10:12,640 --> 00:10:13,680
for my poor daughter.

263
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:15,640
I have nothing.

264
00:10:15,680 --> 00:10:16,560
But you...

265
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:18,360
You're a rising star,

266
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:21,000
trusted by the royal family.

267
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:25,160
How could I miss the chance to use you?

268
00:10:25,880 --> 00:10:27,560
Thank you for today.

269
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:29,280
But I need one more favor.

270
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,480
Once it's done,

271
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,240
I'll return your jade pendant.

272
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,400
What do you need?

273
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:41,600
The late Empress's birthday memorial
is approaching.

274
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:43,080
Go to Zhongning Palace.

275
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:47,280
I didn't know
you appreciated chrysanthemums too.

276
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:50,920
I know a little, that's all.

277
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:19,080
Will this work?

278
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:20,040
Really?

279
00:11:20,040 --> 00:11:21,080
I doubt it.

280
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:25,000
What if she's just bluffing?

281
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:30,600
It's really healed!

282
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:33,880
What a miraculous cure!

283
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,120
Wonderful!

284
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,040
It really worked.

285
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:38,920
Now you can rest easy.

286
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:42,800
Fu Rong, you're truly clever.

287
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:46,320
Consort Qi.

288
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:47,760
I have a request.

289
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:49,000
Go ahead.

290
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:51,200
To have earned your favor

291
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,400
and serve you

292
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:54,080
is a great honor for me.

293
00:11:54,400 --> 00:11:55,760
If you don't mind,

294
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,960
I'd like to serve you,

295
00:11:58,040 --> 00:12:00,280
even as a humble maid.

296
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:01,520
I'll do as you command,

297
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:02,760
and serve you

298
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:04,960
with all my heart.

299
00:12:15,006 --> 00:12:19,200
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

300
00:12:19,900 --> 00:12:24,180
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

301
00:12:24,740 --> 00:12:29,110
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

302
00:12:29,350 --> 00:12:34,020
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

303
00:12:34,620 --> 00:12:38,580
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

304
00:12:39,420 --> 00:12:43,600
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

305
00:12:44,193 --> 00:12:48,480
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

306
00:12:48,860 --> 00:12:53,300
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

307
00:12:53,726 --> 00:12:58,110
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

308
00:12:58,760 --> 00:13:01,720
♪Let the stars and sea♪

309
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:03,440
(Changsheng Gate)

310
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:07,320
♪Wait for your return♪
